# Furigana (op 0x196). SC0000 page 18 shows 篝火 with the ruby かがりび: 8 px MS Gothic, spread over the base word with
# equal 3 px gaps and drawn plain above it (adv_text_draw_ruby_over_row@0x456b40). History redraws the ruby over the
# same word in its 22 px style. Compare the furigana-* shots between targets: the text matches pixel for pixel; the
# scene's wisp and the wait indicator differ by their animation phase (docs/engine-re.md, "Furigana").
# Run on a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-furigana.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 1.5
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=20
wait 1
click newgame.begin
wait-state top=SC0000@0x83f timeout=90  # page 1
wait-state top=SC0000@0x133c click=adv.next every=1.5 timeout=240   # page 17
settle
expect top=SC0000@0x133c

click adv.next
wait-state top=SC0000@0x1a5b timeout=60 # page 18: 今にも消えそうな篝火の如く、…
wait 1
move 400 300
wait 1
shot furigana-page18

wheel up 1
wait-state script=HISTORY timeout=10
wait 2
shot furigana-history
click 778 562                           # the close button
wait-state top=SC0000@0x1a5b timeout=10
